#. copy/eyebrow
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/eyebrow"
msgid "FIRST BELL / NEW STUDENT ARRIVAL WEEK"
msgstr "FIRST BELL / 第一鐘・新生到着週"

#. copy/title
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid "First, arrive. ‘Ordinary student’ is not a field on this form."
msgstr "先來報到。至於「普通學生」——本校沒有這個欄位。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Bring the admission review, confirm which gate you can use and which stop "
"signal you can recognise, then choose one real first destination. The "
"university keeps your choice—and every condition that did not disappear."
msgstr "帶著錄取評議來，確認你走得進哪一扇門、認得哪一種停止信號，再選一個真正想去的第一站。校方會保存你的選擇，也保存沒有消失的條件。"

#. copy/office
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/office"
msgid "NEW STUDENT ARRIVAL OFFICE"
msgstr "NEW STUDENT ARRIVAL OFFICE"

#. copy/officeTitle
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/officeTitle"
msgid "New Student Arrival Office"
msgstr "新生到着室"

#. copy/window
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/window"
msgid "Filing window"
msgstr "本次辦理"

#. copy/issued
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/issued"
msgid "Opened"
msgstr "已開封"

#. copy/completed
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/completed"
msgid "First Bell rung"
msgstr "已響鐘"

#. copy/publicFile
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/publicFile"
msgid "Public blank file"
msgstr "公開空白卷"

#. copy/publicLead
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/publicLead"
msgid ""
"Anyone may read the arrival rules. Only a person with a formal admission "
"review on this device can place a file in the campus record."
msgstr "任何人都可以先閱讀報到規則；只有這台裝置上已有正式錄取評議的人，才能把它寫進校園履歷。"

#. copy/status
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/status"
msgid "Current file status"
msgstr "目前檔案狀態"

#. copy/identityMissing
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/identityMissing"
msgid ""
"No My TU identity exists yet. Creating one will not alter earlier "
"applications or examination records."
msgstr "尚未建立 My TU 身分。先留下本機身分，既有申請和試卷不會被改動。"

#. copy/applicationMissing
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/applicationMissing"
msgid ""
"An on-device identity exists, but no application has been submitted. The "
"Arrival Office will not treat a blank form as an admission letter."
msgstr "已有本機身分，尚無已提交申請。報到室不會把空白願書當成錄取通知。"

#. copy/reviewMissing
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/reviewMissing"
msgid ""
"The application arrived, but the joint faculty review has not issued a "
"result. Aya has a headline ready; this time she must wait."
msgstr "申請已送達，教授聯合審查尚未留下結果。文已經想好標題，但這次必須等。"

#. copy/conditional
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/conditional"
msgid ""
"This is a conditional admission. You may read the rules, but First Bell "
"waits for the formally admitted edition. The conditions remain visible."
msgstr "目前是有條件錄取。你可以讀完報到規則，但第一鐘要等正式錄取版本；原條件不會被藏起來。"

#. copy/notAdmitted
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/notAdmitted"
msgid ""
"The current review still requires a supplement or interview. The office "
"keeps a blank file; it will not rewrite an applicant as a newcomer in "
"advance."
msgstr "目前評議仍要求補件或面試。報到室會保留空白卷，不會提前把申請生改寫成新生。"

#. copy/admitted
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/admitted"
msgid "The formal admission edition is verified. Your on-device arrival file may now be opened."
msgstr "正式錄取版本已核對，可以開封本機報到卷。"

#. copy/goMyTu
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/goMyTu"
msgid "Open My TU"
msgstr "前往 My TU"

#. copy/goApplication
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/goApplication"
msgid "Start an application"
msgstr "開始入學申請"

#. copy/goAdmissions
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/goAdmissions"
msgid "Admissions & examinations"
msgstr "查看招生與試驗"

#. copy/openDossier
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openDossier"
msgid "Open my arrival file"
msgstr "開封我的報到卷"

#. copy/privacy
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/privacy"
msgid ""
"Names, application content, and needs remain in this browser. The BBS "
"receives only a nameless institutional projection."
msgstr "通稱、申請內容與需求只留在這個瀏覽器；BBS 只看得到不含姓名的校務投影。"

#. copy/threeThings
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/threeThings"
msgid "Three things the office will not waive"
msgstr "報到室只堅持三件事"

#. copy/threeLead
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/threeLead"
msgid "This is not a stamp hunt. Every field must still help when a route actually changes."
msgstr "不是集章競賽。每一欄都要在真的需要改道時派得上用場。"

#. copy/ruleOne
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/ruleOne"
msgid "Carry the right edition"
msgstr "帶對版本"

#. copy/ruleOneBody
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/ruleOneBody"
msgid ""
"Admission, conditions, and minority opinions remain separate. A welcome "
"stamp cannot cover them."
msgstr "錄取、條件與少數意見分開保存；沒有一枚「歡迎」印章能把它們蓋掉。"

#. copy/ruleTwo
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/ruleTwo"
msgid "Recognise a way back"
msgstr "認得退路"

#. copy/ruleTwoBody
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/ruleTwoBody"
msgid "Routes may change. Your stop signal must be one you can personally recognise."
msgstr "路線可以變，停止信號必須是你本人確實能辨認的一種。"

#. copy/ruleThree
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/ruleThree"
msgid "Choose a first destination"
msgstr "選第一站"

#. copy/ruleThreeBody
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/ruleThreeBody"
msgid "Completion awards no generic badge; it opens a real route that continues into campus."
msgstr "完成報到不是得到徽章，而是得到一條真的能繼續走下去的校園路線。"

#. copy/dossier
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/dossier"
msgid "ARRIVAL FILE / THIS DEVICE"
msgstr "ARRIVAL FILE / 本機報到卷"

#. copy/dossierTitle
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/dossierTitle"
msgid "This file preserves your choices; it does not rewrite any office into agreement."
msgstr "這份卷宗只替你保存選擇，不替任何辦公室改口。"

#. copy/student
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/student"
msgid "Arriving student"
msgstr "報到人"

#. copy/school
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/school"
msgid "Admitting school"
msgstr "錄取學院"

#. copy/application
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/application"
msgid "Application file"
msgstr "申請卷"

#. copy/review
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/review"
msgid "Review file"
msgstr "評議卷"

#. copy/decision
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/decision"
msgid "Decision"
msgstr "評議結果"

#. copy/question
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/question"
msgid "The question you bring through the gate"
msgstr "你帶進校門的問題"

#. copy/noQuestion
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/noQuestion"
msgid "No question text is available here; the source application remains intact."
msgstr "申請卷沒有可顯示的問題文字；原卷仍保留。"

#. copy/admittedLabel
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/admittedLabel"
msgid "Admitted"
msgstr "正式錄取"

#. copy/stepOne
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepOne"
msgid "01 / ADMISSION EDITION"
msgstr "01 / 錄取版本"

#. copy/stepOneTitle
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepOneTitle"
msgid "First confirm which edition of you the university admitted."
msgstr "先確認校方准備迎接的是哪一個你。"

#. copy/stepOneBody
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepOneBody"
msgid ""
"Akyuu cites the source application and review. She does not copy them into a "
"more obedient second record."
msgstr "阿求只引用原申請與評議編號，不把它們抄成一份更聽話的新資料。"

#. copy/stepTwo
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepTwo"
msgid "02 / ARRIVAL ROUTE"
msgstr "02 / 到校路線"

#. copy/stepTwoTitle
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepTwoTitle"
msgid "Travel from Hakurei Gate to your school."
msgstr "從博麗門走到你的學院。"

#. copy/stepTwoBody
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepTwoBody"
msgid ""
"Choose a mode. Duty incidents, the academic calendar, and a live festival "
"may make the usual shortest route unavailable today."
msgstr "選擇抵達方式；當值事件、校曆與正在運行的祭典可能讓最快的路今天不成立。"

#. copy/chooseMode
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/chooseMode"
msgid "Arrival mode"
msgstr "選擇抵達方式"

#. copy/confirmArrival
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/confirmArrival"
msgid "File this route"
msgstr "把這條路寫進報到卷"

#. copy/routeFiled
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/routeFiled"
msgid "Arrival route confirmed"
msgstr "到校路線已核對"

#. copy/minutes
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/minutes"
msgid "Estimated minutes"
msgstr "預計分鐘"

#. copy/walking
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/walking"
msgid "Walking"
msgstr "其中步行"

#. copy/distance
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/distance"
msgid "Approx. distance"
msgstr "約計距離"

#. copy/routeClosed
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/routeClosed"
msgid ""
"This mode cannot form a complete route today. Choose another or inspect "
"closures on the live map."
msgstr "這種方式今天找不到完整路線。換一種方式，或先到校園地圖查看封路。"

#. copy/openMap
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openMap"
msgid "Open the live campus map"
msgstr "打開當值校園地圖"

#. copy/stepThree
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepThree"
msgid "03 / STOP & NOTICE"
msgstr "03 / 停止與通知"

#. copy/stepThreeTitle
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepThreeTitle"
msgid "Choose a stop signal you can recognise yourself."
msgstr "選你本人認得的停止信號。"

#. copy/stepThreeBody
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepThreeBody"
msgid ""
"The faster a notice travels, the more easily the wrong edition arrives. Stop "
"signal and detour notice are confirmed separately."
msgstr "再快的通知也可能送錯版本；因此停止信號與改道通知分開確認。"

#. copy/signal
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/signal"
msgid "Recognisable stop / exit signal"
msgstr "我能辨認的停止／退路信號"

#. copy/notice
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/notice"
msgid "Detour notice I will verify"
msgstr "我會覆核的改道通知"

#. copy/confirmBoundary
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/confirmBoundary"
msgid "Confirm exit and notice"
msgstr "確認退路與通知"

#. copy/boundaryFiled
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/boundaryFiled"
msgid "Exit field personally confirmed"
msgstr "退路欄已由本人確認"

#. copy/stepFour
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepFour"
msgid "04 / FIRST DESTINATION"
msgstr "04 / 第一站"

#. copy/stepFourTitle
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepFourTitle"
msgid "Where will you go after First Bell?"
msgstr "第一鐘響後，你先往哪裡走？"

#. copy/stepFourBody
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stepFourBody"
msgid ""
"This is not a personality test. It only chooses which real door the arrival "
"file opens next."
msgstr "這不是性格測驗。選擇只決定報到卷替你打開哪一扇真正存在的門。"

#. copy/firstStop
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/firstStop"
msgid "Choose a first destination"
msgstr "選擇第一站"

#. copy/ringBell
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/ringBell"
msgid "Ring First Bell and file arrival"
msgstr "敲響第一鐘，封存報到卷"

#. copy/required
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/required"
msgid "Complete this field first."
msgstr "請先選完這一欄。"

#. copy/arrivalSaved
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/arrivalSaved"
msgid "The arrival route is now in the file."
msgstr "到校路線已寫入報到卷。"

#. copy/boundarySaved
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/boundarySaved"
msgid "Stop signal and detour notice were filed separately."
msgstr "停止信號與改道通知已分欄保存。"

#. copy/completedToast
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/completedToast"
msgid "First Bell rang. Your first destination is open."
msgstr "第一鐘已響；你的第一站現在可以出發。"

#. copy/completeEyebrow
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/completeEyebrow"
msgid "MATRICULATION FILED / ARRIVAL RECORDED"
msgstr "MATRICULATION FILED / 到着記錄成立"

#. copy/completeTitle
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/completeTitle"
msgid "The gates are no more singular. You know which one to use."
msgstr "門沒有變得比較唯一；你已經知道該走哪一扇。"

#. copy/completeLead
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/completeLead"
msgid ""
"The arrival file entered the My TU campus ledger. Your name did not go to "
"the BBS, and welcome copy did not dilute the admission conditions."
msgstr "報到卷已進入 My TU 校園事件帳本。姓名沒有送上 BBS，原錄取條件也沒有被歡迎詞沖淡。"

#. copy/firstDestination
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/firstDestination"
msgid "First destination"
msgstr "第一站"

#. copy/stopSignal
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/stopSignal"
msgid "Stop signal"
msgstr "停止信號"

#. copy/noticePlan
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/noticePlan"
msgid "Detour notice"
msgstr "改道通知"

#. copy/filedAt
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/filedAt"
msgid "First Bell time"
msgstr "第一鐘時間"

#. copy/print
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/print"
msgid "Print / save formal arrival slip"
msgstr "列印／另存正式到着票"

#. copy/depart
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/depart"
msgid "Go to first destination"
msgstr "前往第一站"

#. copy/openBbs
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openBbs"
msgid "See what the BBS says"
msgstr "看看 BBS 怎麼說"

#. copy/openAnother
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openAnother"
msgid "Return to arrival file"
msgstr "返回報到卷"

#. copy/records
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/records"
msgid "arrival files"
msgstr "份報到卷"

#. copy/openFiles
#: src/js/orientation.js:35
msgctxt "tree:copy#/openFiles"
msgid "awaiting First Bell"
msgstr "份尚未響鐘"
